<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-27T00:38:52.461Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF has stepped up drone attacks that have knocked out power in southeast Sudan and hit markets and hospitals, worsening civilian casualties and limiting medical care. The UK has sanctioned Sudanese commanders for their role in a rape campaign in El Fasher, and the UAE is being blamed for fueling bloodshed in the conflict. Refugee camps in Darfur now host the children of those who fled, while gold miners continue to work under dangerous, laborious conditions. The conflict has caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPTlFzbUZKbklnLUFORjB5NHJZQWJpLTYtS2tEWkU2T1JQNkZoNmJlX3NyazNPOGNvUzJvRTVENTFQeFgwN2hrOGZSWGRtOXpQUWpOT3g2d0YxU192WnpRQVBfSXg4aENHVjFOQmNLUXVZYUZTSXRURU1PUmkyb2dualpRMDUxRFlHSEdoM2VacXZORXo0d3FIeEduYmhCYTBwcU9EWE9HdWVDYzZqZThTVm1GUDdnS2xFSlpHWVhld0pWUms?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxQZFowenU3U3JKdTZ2Ny02ejl2TlBYTE1NdEVxM3RhU2xrNE4tQWh2Um1HOXJ0UnNyUHdyOFMxMHd2WThrbjRDR1ZMcFJmUzVwZ1RHTjI2MlRzdl9VNE9QSk85NHNEQ3czQXpMeEFWZlpuTDFhY2lFOUN4M25ibUx4bVZFUk4wSzFOajh5a0lXUVZVZXI1T3FlTlhMOVhDTGh4U29uNDdoNmh3WWpNMU9GRlFxdEdLRkFKLUUyN1ZxWTVOTGZuZThRcTkwZ20?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQTzFZTjVTeEZ2NGxlLTA5OTZNQWtudFh1MmJwR3FvR1hXY0hDQU10a0hldmxXenBaUGlZOUNxTTdZdllEeC1YNlgxVWdGcV9Ddy1GT19TOWF0eGt3WlgwMWZoYi1YaGZLSV8xZEVOZHFIdTFP